        "policy_main": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<div class=\"coach-policy\">\n  <h1>Exchange &amp; Return Policy</h1>\n  <p>We want our customers to be fully satisfied. Please review the policies below:</p>\n  <table>\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>T&amp;C</th>\n        <th>Legit Returns</th>\n        <th>Non-Legit Returns</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Product Condition</td>\n        <td>- Wrong deliveries<br>- Manufacturing defects<br>- Incorrect orders<br>- Damaged on delivery</td>\n        <td>- Unwanted items<br>- Unpleasant items<br>- Late damage reports<br>- Discounted with minor imperfections</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Return Shipping (SAR)</td>\n        <td>Free</td>\n        <td>55 SAR</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Request Time Limit</td>\n        <td>Within 2 days</td>\n        <td>Up to 14 days</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Refunds</td>\n        <td>Full refund incl. shipping &amp; handling</td>\n        <td>Product value only (excl. shipping/handling)</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n  <p><strong>Return exceptions apply:</strong></p>\n  <ul>\n    <li>No returns on items discounted at 70% or more.</li>\n    <li>Returns on 30–70% discounted items: 100 SAR fee.</li>\n    <li>Returns on &lt;30% discounted items: 55 SAR fee.</li>\n    <li>Gift wraps: 75 SAR on all discounted items.</li>\n    <li>Discounted items may have minor imperfections.</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p><strong>Non-returnable items:</strong> Jewelry, fragrances, watches, sunglasses, and accessories.</p>\n  <p><strong>Important:</strong> Damaged item reports made after 2 days will be treated as non-legit returns.</p>\n  <h2>Privacy Clause</h2>\n  <p>Products bought on our website at a promotional or discounted prices, cannot be returned, exchanged, or refunded at physical stores. Any eligible returns must follow the online returns procedure outlined on the website.</p>\n  <h2>Return Procedure</h2>\n  <p>Email <a href=\"mailto:customercare@coach.sa\">customercare@coach.sa</a> to initiate a return. Our team will respond within 24–48 hours. If approved, we will issue a return label and coordinate pick-up via our logistics partner.</p>\n  <p><em>Note: Customer responsiveness is critical for a smooth return process.</em></p>\n  <h2>Refunds</h2>\n  <p>Approved refunds will be processed via the original payment method. Refund times depend on your bank. This policy applies only to purchases made at Coach.sa.</p>\n  <p>Products bought in-store must be addressed to the respective physical locations.</p>\n  <p><strong>Gift Cards are non-returnable and non-refundable.</strong></p>\n  <h2>Exchanges</h2>\n  <p>Exchanges are allowed only for footwear and must be requested within 2 days of receipt. Exchange is only eligible for equal or higher value items.</p>\n  <h2>Order Cancellation</h2>\n  <p>To cancel an order, email <a href=\"mailto:customercare@coach.sa\">customercare@coach.sa</a> before the order is shipped.</p>\n  <h2>Order Pickup &amp; Cancellation Policy</h2>\n  <p>If a customer does not collect his/her order within <strong>3 days</strong> of receiving the pickup notification, the order will be <strong>automatically cancelled and refunded</strong>.<br>A <strong>service fee of 55 SAR</strong> will be deducted from the refund amount to cover processing and handling charges.<br>If a customer requests to cancel the order after receiving the pickup notification, a service fee of <strong>30 SAR</strong> will be applied.</p>\n  <h2>Promotions / Sales</h2>\n  <p>Account holders will be notified of ongoing promotions.</p>\n  <h2>Contact Us</h2>\n  <p>For any queries, email <a href=\"mailto:customercare@coach.sa\">customercare@coach.sa</a>. Our team will reply within 2 business days (Sunday–Thursday, 10 AM to 3 PM). Response times may be longer during high-volume periods.</p>\n  <p><strong>Please note:</strong> <em>with this option, you acknowledge and agree that Coach has no liability for any loss or damage to your order upon its delivery. For more information, visit <a href=\"/pages/faqs\">Terms &amp; Conditions.</a></em></p>\n</div>\n<style>\n  .coach-policy { color: #000; font-family: HelveticaLTPro-Roman, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; }\n  .coach-policy h1 { margin: 0 0 18px; color: #000; font-family: HelveticaLTPro-Bold, Helvetica-bold, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: 0.2px; }\n  .coach-policy h2 { margin: 22px 0 8px; color: #000; font-family: HelveticaLTPro-Bold, Helvetica-bold, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 19px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; }\n  .coach-policy p, .coach-policy li, .coach-policy td, .coach-policy th { color: #000; font-family: HelveticaLTPro-Roman, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 20px; letter-spacing: 0.2px; }\n  .coach-policy p { margin: 0 0 14px; }\n  .coach-policy ul { margin: 0 0 14px; padding-left: 20px; }\n  .coach-policy li { margin: 0 0 4px; }\n  .coach-policy a { color: #000; }\n  .coach-policy table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 10px 0 16px; }\n  .coach-policy th, .coach-policy td { padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #ccc; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }\n  .coach-policy thead th { background: #f2f2f2; font-weight: 700; }\n</style>",
